codelaw-data-polyfills / @codelaw/data-polyfills — codelaw's polyfill table.

The rows in data/polyfills.json are generated by scripts/data-polyfills-check.py
--refresh from the data files of core-js-compat (data.json and entries.json),
read from its published tarball; the package's `generated_from` names the
version and the tarball's integrity. Nothing of core-js-compat is installed or
executed. core-js-compat's own data comes from the engines' release notes, from
kangax's compat-table (MIT) and from MDN's browser-compat-data (CC0).

